0..78 Comment "//! A buffer the ring allocates is live from its allocation until it is freed:"
79..156 Comment "//! the kernel owns it while an operation is in flight and hands it back with"
157..231 Comment "//! the completion [boats-2020-notes_on_io_uring], so the program holds it"
232..311 Comment "//! exactly once at every step. `Buf` is the host\'s buffer, allocated and freed"
312..391 Comment "//! through the `std.io.Ring.Eff` interface; a scope handling `std.io.Ring.Eff`"
392..471 Comment "//! serves the buffers itself, minting each one its `alloc` clause resumes with"
472..527 Comment "//! and reclaiming each one its `free` clause receives."
528..531 Comment "//!"
532..575 Comment "//! - cites: [boats-2020-notes_on_io_uring]"
576..579 Comment "//!"
580..679 Comment "//! [boats-2020-notes_on_io_uring]: https://without.boats/blog/io-uring/ \"boats, Notes on io-uring\""
681..724 Comment "// The native buffer a receive places live."
